  "problem": "Which of the following is **not** a polyhedron?\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14230697/assets/ceedc03f96a3c801f31069f5551a8c0e5241dbabfc5c9463240a1eb1698a7105.png)",
  "worked_solution": "Each face in a polyhedron must be a polygon. Therefore, the only option that is **not** a polyhedron is:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14230697/assets/aea63ad8ff248347de606d37112355cdecc30ab5ae631b987b87f0b9f9d68f17.png)\n\nNotice that one of its faces is not a polygon (it has curved sides).",
