  "html": "<div id=\"step-8914\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"8914\" steptype=\"example\" contentid=\"2668\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    Example: \n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-8914\" class=\"stepAnchor\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\" name=\"step-13\">Identifying Non-Polyhedra</a> \n                </div>      \n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"8914\">?</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                <p>Which of the following is <strong>not</strong> a polyhedron?</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<div id=\"graphic-4efe20841a64bdb15fd00b399be9b633\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/4efe20841a64bdb15fd00b399be9b633\"></div>\n            </div>     \n\n            <div class=\"explanationHeader\">EXPLANATION</div>\n\n            <div class=\"exampleExplanation\">\n                <p>Each face in a polyhedron must be a polygon. Therefore, the only option that is <strong>not</strong> a polyhedron is:</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<div id=\"graphic-e7c018cff615575f30d66457c542d427\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/e7c018cff615575f30d66457c542d427\"></div>\n\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Notice that one of its faces is not a polygon (it has <font style=\"color:red\">curved</font> sides).</p>\n\n            </div>           \n        </div>",
